					<h1>Cogent Consulting</h1>
					
					<P></P>
<P><STRONG>Advanced Commission Management Technologies.</STRONG></P>
<P><A href="/ASSETS/F0E13CA1C34D46A6B53070392AA65EC3/" target=_new>Cogent Consulting</A>&nbsp;is the industry’s leading software development firm specializing in advanced commission management solutions for institutional money managers and broker-dealers worldwide.&nbsp; Our solutions enable investment advisors and hedge funds to gain total control and complete transparency over their trading and research commissions.</P>
<P>We provide premier broker-review, voting and relationship management, commission reporting and reconciliation, CSAs, CCAs and the unbundling of trading and research commissions.&nbsp; Our web-based, proprietary technologies have set the industry benchmark for commission management for both the buy- and sell-side communities.</P>
